# Files that are never part of the delivered site. The repository root is served as static files, so without this
# list, internal documents (for example /CLAUDE.md and /ENGINEERING_READINESS_REVIEW.md) were reachable by URL.
# Keep out: internal Markdown at the root, project records, tests, the RA sync inbox and SQL notes.
# Do NOT list scripts/ (api/_lib requires it at runtime), data/, seasonal/, assets/ or the page templates.
/*.md
/project/
/test/
/ra-sync/
/supabase/
/_to_delete/
